          <div><div class="recruiter-eyebrow">FOCALYT RECRUITER WORKSPACE</div><h1>Find the right talent. Build your team.</h1><p>Welcome back, <%= company?.name || 'hiring team' %>. Your hiring workspace is ready.</p></div>
          <span class="recruiter-badge recruiter-badge-gray">Company account</span>
